ll,null,"/local/business/3565572879703426860/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRuZWxZeFVtMWFWRUp6WTNwc1ZXSnFUbWxrTW14bVdUTkNTazR6WXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/3565572879703426860/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRuZWxZeFVtMWFWRUp6WTNwc1ZXSnFUbWxrTW14bVdUTkNTazR6WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/3565572879703426860/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRuZWxZeFVtMWFWRUp6WTNwc1ZXSnFUbWxrTW14bVdUTkNTazR6WXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/3565572879703426860/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRuZWxZeFVtMWFWRUp6WTNwc1ZXSnFUbWxrTW14bVdUTkNTazR6WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/3565572879703426860/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRuZWxZeFVtMWFWRUp6WTNwc1ZXSnFUbWxrTW14bVdUTkNTazR6WXhBQhAA"],null,["zh-Hant"],[["您好，感謝您願意花時間留下這麼詳細的用餐回饋。\n很抱歉這次的燒肉飯套餐與其他品項，沒有達到您對我們的期待，尤其是在燒肉口感、白飯狀態與湯品風味上，讓您感到不愉快，這並不是我們希望帶給客人的用餐體驗。\n關於您提到的燒肉有油耗味、口感偏硬，以及整體品質不穩定的問題，我們已經轉達給同仁重新檢討備料與加熱流程，避免因保存或處理不當影響風味。白飯與湯品的部分，我們也會一併調整，確保基本品質符合套餐應有的水準\n至於起司煎餃的做法說明不夠清楚，造成您點餐時的誤會，這是我們標示與說明上的疏失。我們會補上菜單註明，並提醒同仁在點餐時主動告知，避免再讓消費者困擾。\n再次向您致歉，也謝謝您直言不諱的指正，這對我們改善真的很重要。希望未來還有機會，用更好的表現重新取得您的信任。",null,[0,99]]]],[null,null,3707,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tnelYxUm1aVEJzY3psVWJqTmlkMmxmWTNCSk4zYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x8b8e991be597067c!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOkgzV1RmZTBsczlUbjNid2lfY3BJN3c%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tnelYxUm1aVEJzY3psVWJqTmlkMmxmWTNCSk4zYxAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tnelYxUm1aVEJzY3psVWJqTmlkMmxmWTNCSk4zYxI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tnelYxUm1aVEJzY3psVWJqTmlkMmxmWTNCSk4zYxILMGROQlVRSHltUVkaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09rZ3pWMVJtWlRCc2N6bFViak5pZDJsZlkzQkpOM2MSCzBkTkJVUUh5bVFZIhIJAAAAAAAAAAARfAaX5R