JBQhAA"],null,["zh-Hant"],[["您好，真的很抱歉讓您有不好的感受 🙏\n關於當天加麵的情況，先跟您說聲抱歉，沒有在第一時間由服務人員主動清楚說明，讓您用餐後才知道假日不提供免費加麵，這確實會讓人覺得不舒服，我們會再加強教育訓練，請同仁在假日時主動提醒顧客「假日沒有提供免費加麵服務」，避免再造成誤會。\n另外也跟您說明，目前店內桌上告示牌以及菜單上都有標示「僅平日提供免費加麵，假日不提供免費加麵服務」，但我們理解，即使有標示，如果現場沒有再次提醒，還是會讓人感到落差，這部分我們會再檢討溝通方式。\n謝謝您願意提出意見，讓我們有機會改進，也期待未來還有機會為您服務 🙇\u200d♂️",null,[0,133]]]],[null,null,1633,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25ob1NWZGxjemxKVlRKWFNHY3ROV1oxTWxKTFExRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x8b8e991be597067c!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOnhoSVdlczlJVTJXSGctNWZ1MlJLQ1E%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25ob1NWZGxjemxKVlRKWFNHY3ROV1oxTWxKTFExRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25ob1NWZGxjemxKVlRKWFNHY3ROV1oxTWxKTFExRRI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25ob1NWZGxjemxKVlRKWFNHY3ROV1oxTWxKTFExRRILMGRjTTUtVVF5MVQaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09uaG9TVmRsY3psSlZUSlhTR2N0TldaMU1sSkxRMUUSCzBkY001LVVReTFUIhIJAAAAAAAAAAARfAaX5RuZjosqCzBkY001LVVReTFU\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwih_OW78dSWAxVUh68BHf5hIrMQoykIfygC"],null,[null,[[1,0]]]],"0ahUKEwja1Oq78dSWAxWIhsoCHW0pBCUQ0pMFCDUoAw"],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwih_OW78dSWAxVUh68BHf5hIrMQ0pMFCHwoAw"],[["ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURmbS1lV25RRRAB",["0x0:0x8b8e991be597067c",null,1736512482942681,1736595074548752,[null,null,["https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115277602709814304892/reviews?hl\u003dzh-TW"],null,null,["蒲建宏","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX-qZgLPOUf-wNHzcEsGoVRbo-CAsOYxrCFO-tAIobmoTlFZ0I\u003ds120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100",["https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115277602709814304892?hl\u003dzh-TW"],"115277602709814304892",null,16,3,null,[1,4,1],5,["在地嚮導 · 16 則評論",null,null,null,null,[null,"0ahUKEwih_OW78dSWAxVUh68BHf5hIrMQpr8GCIEBKAA"]]]],null,"1 年前",null,null,null,null,null,null,["Google","https://www.gstatic.com/images/branding/product/1x/googleg_48dp.png",null,null,5],null,1],[[1],null,[["CIHM0ogKEICAgIDfm-fREQ",["CIH